    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p>Advanced omni-tool integration lets you chain tech powers with less downtime. Your tech powers deal <strong>+4 damage</strong> to each creature they damage (replacing the +2 from Tech Mastery), and the cooldowns of your tech powers are <strong>1 round shorter</strong>, to a minimum of 2 rounds.</p><p><em>Prerequisite: Tech Mastery. Classes: Engineer, Infiltrator, Sentinel.</em></p><hr/><p><em>Automation: The damage bonus is added when a creature rolls its save against the power and the module applies the damage. Add it by hand to power damage you roll yourself. Using a tech power puts its cooldown on your sheet as an effect, with the shorter cooldown counted.</em></p>"
    },
